  "response": {
    "items": [
      {
        "id": "book001-b000891-p000-b8c8bf90c7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "## 形气篇",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000892-p000-4b62f6a319",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "宇宙间有重大的会合规律，以炁运为主导；山川有真实的情性与形态，以炁势为优先。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000893-p000-296b6c30da",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "地运有推移变化，而天炁随之而动；天运有转徙变迁，而地气随之应和。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000894-p000-65661ec49d",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "天炁在上运动，而人方随之应和；人在下行动，而天气随之随从。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000895-p000-0b0d85b64b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "有聚讲、行讲、坐讲，则气聚于龙。有权星、尊星、雄星，则炁聚于势。有盖胎、夹胎、乘胎，则气聚于穴。有收襟、收堂、收关，则炁聚于局。阴胜逢阳则止，阳胜逢阴则住。雄龙须要雌龙御，雌龙须要雄龙簇。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000896-p000-83a8eefbfb",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "大地若无明显形体，要看其气概；小地若无明显势态，要看其精神。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000897-p000-1471f4cbd7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "水形成形体时，山气在山上停止；山形成形体时，水气在水中停止。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000898-p000-e62496f539",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "在大处认气，看父母星以尊星为主；在真处认气，看子息星以主星为主；在方处认气，看交媾以胎伏星为主；在成处认气，看胎育以胎息星为主；在化处认气，看煞为权以解星为主；在逢处认气，看绝而生以恩星为主。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000899-p000-cf19a3ae61",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "认龙之气要以势为准，认穴之气要以情为准。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000900-p000-2cc1771593",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龙具备五行之全，所以山的形体像龙。龙极尽变化之神，所以山的变换像龙。龙之体纯乎阳，所以山逢阳而化，遇阳而生。龙之性喜乎水，所以山夹水为界，得水而住。龙之行御乎风，所以山乘风则腾，藏风则歇。龙必得巢乃栖，所以山以有关有局为聚，以无局无关为散。龙凡遇物则配，所以山以有配有合而止，以无配无合而行。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000901-p000-043d9e6ef9",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "辨别龙的生死，须分三阴三阳。辨别穴的生死，须识阳多阴少。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000902-p000-d7fb18d686",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龙有变体，有时顿住勒住。穴有变格，或为坠宫篡宫。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000903-p000-e6a313824e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "星体有正有附，兼衬贴之应当辨别。穴情有显有晦，并气影之宜详察。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000904-p000-89db989057",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "盖帐不开龙不巢，轮晕不覆穴不住，束咽不细气不聚，泥丸不满气不充。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000905-p000-273c68040a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "五星不离水土体，九星常要辅弼随。土星不作倚，五星皆有撞，水火不可盖，水土岂能粘。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000906-p000-851d4788c9",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "坐宕、坐旺、坐煞，是为坐法。全胎、保胎、破胎，是为作法。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000907-p000-c2f98bdf5e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "挨生傍炁，或为脱壳借胎，或为子投母腹。脱煞逢生，或为借母养子，或为以子救母。脱龙就局纳前朝，只为半伪半真；撩山劈硬处平基，只畏直来直受。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000908-p000-7faaa391d7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "平洋之气，常舒常散，须要汤里浮酥。山陇之气，常急常敛，当看水面蟠蛇。没水之牛，气仰而吹，宜乘其气。出洞之龙，炁直而吐，宜乘其余。精华外露之气如华，宜葬其皮。精华内敛之气如果，宜葬其实。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000909-p000-0858ff7ccd",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龙穴有阴阳，砂水亦有阴阳；龙穴有生死，砂水亦有生死。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000910-p000-fea7f4b68e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "气有虚实，法当以实投虚，以虚乘实。气有先后，法当先到先收，后到后收。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      }
    ]
  },
